  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of a shared vegetable garden in Bogota</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Foundation Proyectar Sin Fronteras wants to implement a solidarity project based on food security and sharing. Our objective? To combine the distribution of food with the creation of a solidarity vegetable garden in the illegal neighborhood of Tocaimita, located in the town of Usme on the outskirts of Bogota, the capital of Colombia.   We carry out this work with the indigenous leaders of the community, who are our relay in the organization of workshops and in the creation of our garden.</narrative>
  </description>
